# Files inside public/ that must NOT be published.
#
# This is now almost empty, and that is the point: public/ contains the site and
# nothing else, so private files are excluded by living outside this directory
# rather than by being listed here.

# The map's overview tileset, 26.5 MiB — over Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-asset
# limit, so it is served from R2 at tiles.cedarhollow.uk instead. An oversized
# file fails the whole deploy, so this line matters.
/map/southern-england.pmtiles

